# 8080 con docker compose, 5000 con dotnet run
@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = pegar-aqui-el-access_token

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telefono": "70000000",
  "password": "Admin12345"
}

### Listar usuarios (no pide token)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users?page=1&pageSize=20

### Obtener uno
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "test",
  "apellidos": "test",
  "fechanacimiento": "1996-05-10",
  "telefono": "73212656",
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "Prueba123",
  "direccion": "direccion"
}

### Actualizar (password opcional)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "María José",
  "apellidos": "López Ramírez",
  "fechanacimiento": "1995-06-21",
  "telefono": "71234567",
  "email": "maria.lopez@abank-pruebas.com",
  "direccion": "Col. San Benito, San Salvador"
}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/users/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
